              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Petitioner, petitioners maintain that Congress must have authority\u2014express or implicit\u2014to require the State Department to list \u201cJerusalem, Israel\u201d on passports, as required by prior Supreme Court precedent on passport authority."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "Petitioner",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "23b8a204b8836873f7e4a1f94a1661b5b4eca0831e9c1819020e8c1cf7943f55",
              "evidence_ids": [
