              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 23,
                "start": 23
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Petitioner, they argue that the issue is not a non\u2011justiciable political question because the Court has previously decided similar foreign\u2011policy\u2011related disputes, citing Baker v. Carr."
        }
      ],
      "heading": "Petitioner Position",
      "status": "complete",
      "summary": null,
      "summary_citations": []
    },
    {
